config FINGERPRINT_FS_TEE
	tristate "FortSense fingerprint sensor (TEE)"
	depends on INPUT_FINGERPRINT && OF && GPIOLIB
	help
	  Power, reset and IRQ control for the FortSense sensor on sweet.
	  The sensor is driven over SPI by the TEE; this driver gives the
	  HAL /dev/fortsense_fp and IRQ uevents. GPIOs and the supply come
	  from the "fs,fingerprint" node and are claimed only when the HAL
	  asks, so it can share pins with the FPC driver.

	  To compile it as a module, choose M here: the module will be
	  called fortsense_fp.
